                <p rendition="#flush">Subject: Division of German Naval Vessels.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Reference: <hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>. SWNCC
                        208/10.<anchor n="59" xml:id="d1150-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>The State-War-Navy Coordinating Committee has approved, on behalf of the United
                    States Government, the division of German naval <pb facs="1530" n="1520"
                        xml:id="pg1520"/> vessels as outlined in reference <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >a</hi>. The division of these vessels is as follows:</p>
